# 仓库内统一存 LF；shell/sql/nginx 这些要在 Linux 上跑的文件强制 LF，
# 避免 Windows 上 core.autocrlf 把工作副本换成 CRLF 后脚本无法执行
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
*.bash text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.conf text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.vue text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary
